==Dutch==

===Interjection===
'''hoi'''

# {{Northern Dutch}} An informal greeting acknowledging someone’s arrival or presence; compare English [[hey]], [[hi]]
#: '''''Hoi,''' hoe gaat het?'' — Hey, how's it going?

